<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 219,571.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 219,571.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of May 8 totaled 219,571 bales, down from 220,858 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, no decertification orders, and 1,287 cancellations.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
